      "name": "[Corin] Speed-Cleaning Technique",
      "desc": "During the 1st, 2nd and 3rd hits of a <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist</color>, repeatedly press or hold Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to <color=#2BAD00>directly follow up with the 4th hit of the Basic Attack</color> and launch a <color=#2BAD00>high-speed spin slash at enemies</color> ahead, and when Corin triggers a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color>, she <color=#2BAD00>recovers 20 Energy</color> once per 10s.",
